  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "法律經濟學(二)",
    "sub_ename": "LAW AND ECONOMICS(2)",
    "describe_ch": "從經濟學的角度看法律的原則，也就是以經濟模型對法律原則作經濟分析，探討是否有效率。下學期主要的內容有：侵權行為法、訴訟程序法、刑法等的經濟分析等。",
    "describe_eh": "This course uses Economics to help us to view laws as incentives for changing behavior, and as instruments for policy objectives, efficiency and distribution. Several topics will be covered in the second semester, such as economic analysis of tort liability, legal process, and crime and punishment.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
